e]] [[most]] [[fun]].`,`vn`:`T\u1ed1i n\u00e0o c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ed9i c\u0169ng t\u1eadp ch\u1ea1y. Ch\u00fa Hai bi\u1ebfn n\u00f3 th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed9c \u0111ua, ai v\u1ec1 nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u01b0\u1edfng m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ed3 ch\u01a1i nh\u1ecf. Quang th\u1eafng m\u1ecdi cu\u1ed9c \u0111ua. Bin ch\u01b0a th\u1eafng l\u1ea7n n\u00e0o, nh\u01b0ng c\u1eadu l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ee9a vui nh\u1ea5t.`},{`en`:`Cuong [[was|be]] [[not]] [[happy]]. \`[[I]] [[am|be]] [[a]] [[real]] [[athlete]],\` [[he]] [[said|say]]. \`[[I]] [[can]] [[play]] [[every]] [[sport]]: [[basketball]], [[baseball]], [[golf]], [[hockey]]. [[I]] [[can]] [[ski]] [[too]].\` Na [[laughed|laugh]]. \`[[Skiing]]? [[In]] Hanoi? [[There]] [[is|be]] [[no]] [[snow]] [[here]]!\``,`vn`:`C\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng vui. \`T\u1edb m\u1edbi l\u00e0 v\u1eadn \u0111\u1ed9ng vi\u00ean th\u1ef1c th\u1ee5,\` c\u1eadu n\u00f3i. \`M\u00f4n n\u00e0o t\u1edb c\u0169ng ch\u01a1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c: b\u00f3ng r\u1ed5, b\u00f3ng ch\u00e0y, golf, kh\u00fac c\u00f4n c\u1ea7u. T\u1edb c\u00f2n tr\u01b0\u1ee3t tuy\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1eefa.\` Na b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`Tr\u01b0\u1ee3t tuy\u1ebft \u00e1? \u1ede H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i \u00e1? \u1ede \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0m g\u00ec c\u00f3 tuy\u1ebft!\``},{`en`:`Mr Huy [[watched|watch]] [[from]] [[his]] [[garden]] [[across]] [[the]] [[street]]. [[He]] [[was|be]] [[their]] [[first]] [[fan]]. [[He]] [[sent|send]] Na an [[award]]: [[a]] [[paper]] [[star]]. [[It]] [[said|say]], \`[[The]] [[best]] [[hands|hand]] [[on]] Lotus Street.\` [[After]] [[training]], Grandma Lan [[brought|bring]] [[soup]] [[for]] [[everybody]]. \`[[Eat]] [[first]], [[talk]] [[later]]!\``,`vn`:`\u00d4ng Huy \u0111\u1ee9ng xem t\u1eeb khu v\u01b0\u1eddn b\u00ean kia \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng. \u00d4ng l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u00e2m m\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ed9i. \u00d4ng g\u1eedi t\u1eb7ng Na m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i th\u01b0\u1edfng: m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4i sao b\